@@ -3,3 +3,16 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory rental service:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` registers a board or sail, priced per day in euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the cost of renting an item for a period, without booking it.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books the item for the period and returns the booking, including its id.
+
+A period is given as UTC ISO-8601 strings and must cover whole days: it starts at midnight UTC and ends
+at midnight UTC on the day after its last day. `quote` and `book` throw for an unknown item or a period
+that does not meet this rule; `book` also throws if the item is already booked for any part of the
+period. Cancellation is not implemented yet.
